    "body": "Maybe we should not systematically use dangerouslySetInnerHTML. What about:\n\n``` js\nif(isEelement) {\n  return <div...>{content}</div>\n}\nreturn <div...  dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{__html: content}}/>\n```\n",
